{
  "_comment": "Hand-curated map: selector node dummy_* stat id -> ordered list of options. An option is either a bare stat id (value-less; the {0} placeholder is stripped in the UI) or { id, v } where v is the magnitude (number, or [n,n] for two-value templates; negative v selects the 'reduced' wording). Labels are resolved from data/atlas_variant_labels.json at bake time. Keyed by dummy stat id so nodes sharing a selector (e.g. Crystalline Patterns + Essence Dowsing; Overlord's Influence + Domain) map identically. Selection identity is the option's index in this list, so the same stat id may appear twice with different values (e.g. Shape the Chains pack size +15 / -20). Selectors whose options are not present in the export are intentionally absent (no picker).",

